{
  "kind": "html",
  "caption": "先把所有数字放入哈希集合，去重后即可用 O(1) 的平均时间判断某个数字是否存在。只有当 x−1 不在集合中时，x 才可能是连续序列的起点，再从它向右逐个扩展。示例中 1 是起点并扩展到 4，得到最长长度 4；每个数字只参与常数次判断，整体时间复杂度为 O(n)。",
  "html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n<title>最长连续序列可视化</title>\n<style>\n*{box-sizing:border-box}html,body{margin:0;min-height:auto;background:#1c1c1c;color:#d4d4d4;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"PingFang SC\",sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:1.45}.wrap{width:100%;max-width:560px;margin:0 auto;padding:8px 10px 10px;display:block}.panel{border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:6px;background:#252526;padding:8px 10px;box-shadow:none}.title{font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:#d4d4d4;margin-bottom:4px}.sub{color:#8d8d8d;margin-bottom:6px;font-size:12px}.section{margin:6px 0}.label{margin-bottom:4px;color:#3794ff;font-size:10px}.mono,.num,.metric{font-family:\"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace}.set{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px}.num{min-width:38px;padding:4px 8px;text-align:center;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:4px;background:#2d2d30;font-size:13px;transition:.35s}.num.focus{border-color:#3794ff}.num.hit{background:#0e639c;border-color:#3794ff;color:#fff}.flow{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:6px;margin-top:6px}.card{background:#2d2d30;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:6px;padding:8px 10px;min-height:auto}.card-title{color:#3794ff;margin-bottom:4px;font-size:10px}.status{line-height:1.45;font-size:12px}.sequence{display:flex;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:4px;min-height:28px}.arrow{color:#3794ff;font-size:12px}.metric{font-size:13px;color:#d4d4d4}.accent{color:#3794ff}.bar{height:3px;background:#3c3c3c;border-radius:4px;overflow:hidden;margin-top:6px}.fill{height:100%;width:0;background:#3794ff;transition:width .4s}.hint{margin-top:6px;padding:8px 10px;border-left:3px solid #3794ff;background:#2a2d2e;color:#8d8d8d;font-size:11px;line-height:1.45}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"wrap\"><section class=\"panel\">\n<div class=\"title\">最长连续序列：只从真正的起点出发</div>\n<div class=\"sub mono\">nums = [100, 4, 200, 1, 3, 2]</div>\n<div class=\"section\"><div class=\"label\">① 放入哈希集合（用于快速查询）</div><div class=\"set\" id=\"set\"></div></div>\n<div class=\"flow\">\n<div class=\"card\"><div class=\"card-title\">② 当前检查</div><div class=\"status\" id=\"status\">准备开始……</div></div>\n<div class=\"card\"><div class=\"card-title\">③ 向右扩展连续序列</div><div class=\"sequence\" id=\"sequence\"><span style=\"color:#777\">等待找到起点</span></div><div class=\"bar\"><div class=\"fill\" id=\"fill\"></div></div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"hint\" id=\"hint\">判断规则：若集合中不存在 <span class=\"mono\">x − 1</span>，才从 <span class=\"mono\">x</span> 开始扩展，避免重复扫描同一段序列。</div>\n</section></main>\n<script>\nconst values=[100,4,200,1,3,2], lookup=new Set(values), frames=[];\nlet best=0;\nfor(const x of lookup){\n if(lookup.has(x-1)){frames.push({x,sequence:[],best,text:(x-1)+' 已存在, '+x+' 不是起点, 直接跳过.'});continue}\n const sequence=[x];best=Math.max(best,1);\n frames.push({x,sequence:[...sequence],best,text:(x-1)+' 不存在, 从 '+x+' 开始扩展.'});\n let y=x+1;\n while(lookup.has(y)){sequence.push(y);best=Math.max(best,sequence.length);frames.push({x,y,sequence:[...sequence],best,text:'找到 '+y+', 当前连续长度为 '+sequence.length+'.'});y++}\n frames.push({x,sequence:[...sequence],best,text:y+' 不存在, 本段结束. 继续检查剩余集合元素.'});\n}\nframes.push({x:null,sequence:[1,2,3,4],best,text:'已检查所有集合元素, 最长连续长度为 4.'});\nconst setBox=document.getElementById('set');\nvalues.forEach(v=>{const e=document.createElement('div');e.className='num';e.textContent=v;e.dataset.v=v;setBox.appendChild(e)});\nlet index=0;\nfunction render(){const f=frames[index];\n [...setBox.children].forEach(e=>{e.className='num';if(+e.dataset.v===f.x)e.classList.add('focus');if(f.sequence.includes(+e.dataset.v))e.classList.add('hit')});\n document.getElementById('status').textContent=(f.x===null?'扫描完成. ':'检查 x = '+f.x+'. ')+f.text;\n document.getElementById('sequence').innerHTML=f.sequence.length?f.sequence.map(v=>'<span class=\"num hit\">'+v+'</span>').join('<span class=\"arrow\">→</span>'):'本步不扩展';\n document.getElementById('fill').style.width=(f.sequence.length/4*100)+'%';\n document.getElementById('hint').textContent='历史最大长度: '+f.best+'. 只从没有前驱的数字开始, 每个数字只扩展一次. 哈希查询平均 O(1), 总时间期望 O(n), 空间 O(n).';\n index=(index+1)%frames.length;\n}\nrender();setInterval(render,1600);\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>",
  "svg": "",
  "media": ""
}
